{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Only Up? Climb The Tower! is a high-difficulty 3D jump action game where you aim to reach the top of a giant, mysterious tower.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683640/extras/tower01.gif?t=1746164692\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The higher you climb, the more intense the tension becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Precise jumps, quick reflexes, and unwavering determination are key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every step is a test of your focus and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What awaits at the top? See it for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---A single-player 3D vertical platformer with gradually increasing difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---Real-time physics-based jumping and movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---Includes save points</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---Explore a mysterious, immersive world as you ascend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---Beautiful and fantastical scenery to soothe your mind when you need a break</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---<strong>Clear Time Display</strong>: Your total time to reach the top will be displayed upon completion, perfect for speedrunners aiming to beat their best record</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you have what it takes to conquer the tower?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3683640?t=1746164692","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3683640?t=1746164692","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683640/65d2a36288483ded7ff4c9155be71085c720c4e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746164692","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683640/65d2a36288483ded7ff4c9155be71085c720c4e7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746164692","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Only Up? Climb The Tower! is a high-difficulty 3D jump action game where you aim to reach the top of a giant, mysterious tower.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683640/extras/tower01.gif?t=1746164692\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The higher you climb, the more intense the tension becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Precise jumps, quick reflexes, and unwavering determination are key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every step is a test of your focus and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What awaits at the top? See it for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---A single-player 3D vertical platformer with gradually increasing difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---Real-time physics-based jumping and movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---Includes save points</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---Explore a mysterious, immersive world as you ascend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---Beautiful and fantastical scenery to soothe your mind when you need a break</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---<strong>Clear Time Display</strong>: Your total time to reach the top will be displayed upon completion, perfect for speedrunners aiming to beat their best record</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you have what it takes to conquer the tower?</p>","developers":["NTSBrothers"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683640/16105f1721fa47fc42c76adbdbda2cff055e8e8e/header.jpg?t=1746164692","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257130579,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130579/movie480.mp4?t=1745644954","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130579/movie_max.mp4?t=1745644954"},"name":"trailer_1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257130579/1f355d4cfc1a693afdf35e32bea09c764f244eb2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745644954","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130579/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745644954","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130579/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745644954"}}],"name":"Only up?Climb The Tower!","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows\u00ae 10 64 Bit <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5-6600K / AMD Phenom\u2122 II X4 810 @ 2.60 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows\u00ae 10 64 Bit (latest update) or Windows\u00ae 11 64 Bit (latest update)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i7-4770 or AMD Ryzen\u2122 5 1400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong